DS. Matrix multiplication
mmu:+/&*&:=@1 2@2

DS. Monadic binary encode ('#:')
enc:{{(y):(x,`2|y)v 0!`y%2)x}}@1 0&`E.

DS. Join list of strings on separator
jn:' '&:{{>(<[,x,])@>/y}}

DS. Maximum
max:{{(0>y-x):x)y}}@0

DS. Minimum
min:{{(0>y-x):y)x}}@0

DS. Binary Encode+ (from ayr.js)
ENC::(0&#,>&[)"&:(-`"&:(max/)#&>")@1#:

